  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 503.01 Forms",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 503.01 Forms.\n\n(a) Whenever a person is required to complete a form, the following shall apply:\n\n(1) Forms shall be filled out completely;\n\n(2) Forms shall be completed in a legible manner; and\n\n(3) Forms shall be completed in non-fading, non-erasable ink, except that vehicle registrations and municipal permits shall be printed on division approved printers and paper.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
